// and the second is the load-bearing one:
//
//   - a `no_std` world hand-decodes this, and a varint plus a length-delimited
//     field is a few lines where a oneof is a dispatch table;
//   - PASS-THROUGH (D2) carries an app's own request bytes, which have no schema
